        },
        {
          "id": 419317391,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "\"I am not sure the fix is right/complete, even if all fragments are available, a dissector might ask for even more data. These flags were added to the TCP dissector in commit ca423314373b0a4ce7d6bc1cf94c4995e1263ea2 where an additional case exists to clear the flag in case the subdissector requests more data. Is that also needed here?\"\n\nYes, I think you are right, we need to do clear the flag for that case.\nI will update the patch.",
